<title>RUSSIA: TABLE-C.BANK DOLLAR/ROUBLE RATES 5798/5818.</title>
<headline>TABLE-C.BANK DOLLAR/ROUBLE RATES 5798/5818.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Russian Central Bank said it had set 5798/5818 roubles per dollar as its bid and offer rates for its operations on the currency market on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The official rate for Wednesday will be 5808.</p>
<p>On Monday the bid/offer rates were 5798/5818, with the official dollar rate 5808 from Tuesday.</p>
<p>The Central Bank announces daily bid/offer dollar/rouble rates for its currency operations. The midpoint of these rates is the official dollar/rouble rate for the following day.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
